slice from target to root. Then build new root as target, then for each ancestor
in path order, create node with value ancestor, set its children to previous 
tree. Return new root. Also PathTo can use findPath from root to each node and 
compute LCA. That part fine. Implement helper to get path from node to root. Use
findNodeAndParent to get parent chain. Let's modify.

